# frontend/README.md is a committed, generated COPY of the root README.md (docs/APP-DESIGN.md
# §8's "README sync" requirement) — Prettier reformatting its Markdown prose (italic-marker
# style, table-column padding) would break the byte-identical copy CI's readme-contract job
# requires. Never hand-edit this file; regenerate via `make sync-readmes`.
frontend/README.md

# frontend/src/schema.d.ts is generated by `openapi-typescript` from backend/schema.yml (see
# frontend/package.json's `generate:types` script) — CI's `check-generated-types` step
# regenerates it fresh and `git diff --exit-code`s the result against what's committed, so the
# generator's own formatting has to be exactly what's committed. Letting Prettier reformat it
# would make every regeneration read as "stale" even when the schema hasn't changed — the two
# CI checks would permanently fight each other. The generator owns this file's formatting, not
# Prettier.
frontend/src/schema.d.ts
